{
  "name": "Load-Cell Instrumentation Amplifier",
  "description": "A strain-gauge / load-cell front end: a Wheatstone bridge (one arm detuned to model strain) feeds a classic 3-op-amp instrumentation amplifier with a gain-set resistor (gain ≈100). Run an operating-point (op) analysis — the ~5mV bridge differential is amplified to ~0.5V at the output while the large common-mode excitation is rejected. (Validated on ngspice: gain 99.9.)",
  "tags": [
    "sensor",
    "instrumentation",
    "load-cell",
    "strain-gauge",
    "wheatstone",
    "opamp",
    "advanced"
